Durable memory for this workspace. Maintained by Continual Learning plugin + manual edits.

## Learned User Preferences

- Portuguese OK for chat; keep code/identifiers in English unless this discipline is PT-first (match enunciado/slide names)
- Prefer Matt `/teach` for multi-session study in this folder (`MISSION.md` / lessons); use pstack `/how` or pstack `/teach` to explain code — they are different skills
- Teach step-by-step; do not finish PBLs/listas/provas or write the full solution for the student
- Student iterates (e.g. pastes partial source, says `pronto`) — advance one pedagogical step at a time
- Ground teaching in professor materials (`Modulos/`, `Slides/`, enunciados) before inventing patterns; re-read sources if the student says a slide was missed
- Before coursework zip/hand-in: verify sources are real files not folders; flatten when required; compile/check when asked

